{
  "$comment": "Researchly's own eligibility rules for text fields (docs/inline-review-design.md section 6). Written from scratch for Researchly, 2026-10-15. The overlay clients never attach to a field that is secure, or whose label, placeholder, identifier or (for forms) an ancestor's name contains one of these terms. Matching is case-insensitive, on word boundaries for Latin scripts and as substrings for the others. Add terms here, not in code.",
